        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-04T22:50:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you look under the “How to play” menu in-game, under “Gameplay” there is a section called “Repeating Decisions” which explains it.  Basically you can press and hold choices to make it last for the rest of the turn or the rest of the game.  It should apply to all versions of the app.</p>",
